{
  "subject": "Your Venn application: step 1 of 3 done",
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>Your Venn application: step 1 of 3 done</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f2\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden\">Two short steps left. The LinkedIn post is already written for you.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f4f2;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 36px 0\"><img src=\"https://joinvenn.org/Venn_Horizontal_Logo_Light.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Venn\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:-22px;border:0\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 36px 0;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4f7f55;font-weight:600\">Venn F26 &middot; Step 1 of 3 done</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 36px 0;font-size:30px;line-height:36px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.6px;color:#111\">Thanks, {{first_name}}. Two short steps left.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 36px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#333\">Your application is in, and a person reads every one. A LinkedIn post about Venn counts most toward your application, and each friend who applies through your link counts too, up to 10.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 36px 0\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 0\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td width=\"22\" height=\"22\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:11px;background:#4f7f55;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</td><td style=\"padding-left:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#888;text-decoration:line-through\">Applied</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 0\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:11px;border:2px solid #cfcfca\"></td><td style=\"padding-left:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#111;font-weight:600\">Post on LinkedIn</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 0\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:11px;border:2px solid #cfcfca\"></td><td style=\"padding-left:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#111;font-weight:600\">Refer friends</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:24px 36px 0\"><a href=\"{{refer_link}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:999px;background:#111;color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Finish steps 2 and 3 &rarr;</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:12px 36px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#666\">About two minutes. The post is already written for you; you fill in one blank.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px 36px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">Button not working? <a href=\"{{refer_link}}\" style=\"color:#666\">{{refer_link}}</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 36px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#333\">If you're picked, you'll hear from us at this address.<br><br>Venn</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 36px 32px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#555\">P.S. A friend counts once they apply through your link. You&#x27;ll find it on the next page.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:18px 36px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#999;text-align:center\">You're getting this because you applied at joinvenn.org.<br>Reply to this email to reach us.</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "text": "Hi {{first_name}},\n\nYour Venn F26 application is in: step 1 of 3 done. A person reads every one.\n\nA LinkedIn post about Venn counts most toward your application, and each friend who applies through your link counts too, up to 10.\n\n[x] Applied\n[ ] Post on LinkedIn\n[ ] Refer friends\n\nAbout two minutes. The post is already written for you; you fill in one blank.\nFinish steps 2 and 3: {{refer_link}}\n\nIf you're picked, you'll hear from us at this address.\n\nVenn\n\nP.S. A friend counts once they apply through your link. You'll find it on the next page.\n\nYou're getting this because you applied at joinvenn.org. Reply to this email to reach us."
}
